    │   differs: smtplib raises SMTPException subclasses, apprise returns boolean 
    │   success/failure from notify()
    ├── Constraints: requires_connector
    └── The file uses stdlib smtplib to construct an SMTP connection and send a raw 
        email message via sendmail(). The source docstring explicitly identifies apprise
        as the intended substitution target for multi-service (not just email) 
        notifications. Both serve the same functional role of delivering an 
        alert/notification to recipients, so apprise is a genuine candidate despite 
        differing APIs.

